+// Helper class to access FAST_ and SLOW_SLOPPY_ARGUMENTS_ELEMENTS
+//
+// +---+-----------------------+
+// | 0 | Context* context      |
+// +---------------------------+
+// | 1 | FixedArray* arguments +----+ FAST_HOLEY_ELEMENTS
+// +---------------------------+    v-----+-----------+
+// | 2 | Object* param_1_map   |    |  0  | the_hole  |
+// |...| ...                   |    | ... | ...       |
+// |n+1| Object* param_n_map   |    | n-1 | the_hole  |
